# THE FISHING GENRE'S FILES: everything here is fishing's, and nothing outside it is. A game made
# without fishing (the template) is this repo with these paths removed:
#   python tools/template/strip_genre.py fishing
# Directories end in /. Globs are git pathspecs. `@rate_limit <reducer>` drops that line from
# shared/rules.json's rate_limits. The bindings (spacetime_bindings/) regenerate at codegen.
